WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.281
Articles, demonstratives and quantifiers help identify which noun or how much is

00:00:05.281 --> 00:00:05.704
meant.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.733
Which article completes “ blank orange”? Answer: an

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:14.331
Write sentences using a, an, the, some, these and which correctly.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.888
Discuss why: Use an before a vowel sound.
